178
00:09:32,110 --> 00:09:40,050
So Marco, when you were a kid and your teacher said, what jobs are there, what professions are there, what profession would you like, what did you answer?

179
00:09:40,610 --> 00:09:43,150
I always wanted to be a pilot.

180
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:44,400
Oh, pilot.

181
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,840
So you wanted to fly airplanes.

182
00:09:46,050 --> 00:09:47,290
Yeah, I wanted to be a jet pilot.

183
00:09:47,890 --> 00:09:59,770
Actually I collected books about it, I read up about it, so even till now I probably still remember like the capacity of certain jets or what types of weapons they have.

184
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:01,360
I was really, really into it.

185
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,910
Wow, I never knew this about you.

186
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,090
Yeah, what about you?

187
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:06,980
I could never decide as a kid.

188
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:15,800
I remember we had to draw pictures of what I will look like in 20 years and everyone had these pictures, I will be a doctor, I'll be a veterinarian, I'll be the president.

189
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:20,200
I never knew what to draw, so I think I copied my friend, she wanted to be a lawyer.

190
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:22,400
I was like, okay, that sounds okay.

191
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:28,520
Yeah, I think it's hard and usually what you want to be as a kid, you don't do it when you're older.

192
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:34,080
Yeah, it's because of my vision, I didn't have 20-20 vision to actually join the Air Force.

193
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:36,760
Well, and a lot of kids don't know how many jobs there are out there.

194
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:40,640
You know the big ones, doctor, lawyer, fireman, policeman, astronaut.

195
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:45,400
So I guess the question for you is what's your profession?

196
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:52,060
Tell us about it, especially if it's one of the less famous professions out there, because there's a lot that I don't know about those.

197
